{'symbol': 'TECH', 'date': '2023-01-31 07:00:00', 'title': 'BIO-TECHNE ANNOUNCES RETIREMENT, APPOINTMENT OF GENERAL COUNSEL', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS , JAN. 31, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BIO-TECHNE CORPORATION (NASDAQ: TECH) TODAY ANNOUNCED SHANE BOHNEN HAS BEEN APPOINTED SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, GENERAL COUNSEL EFFECTIVE MARCH 3, 2023.\xa0 MR. BOHNEN SUCCEEDS BRENDA FURLOW, WHO WILL BE RETIRING FROM THE COMPANY AFTER SERVING AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND GENERAL COUNSEL FOR THE PAST NINE YEARS.'}